//    (__fadd_rn/__fsub_rn/__fmul_rn/__fdiv_rn) and every float64 operation
//    inside glibc_expf/glibc_powf uses __dadd_rn/__dsub_rn/__dmul_rn/
//    __fma_rn.  That pins the hardware rounding mode AND makes nvcc's
