//
// AND OURS IS THE CLOSER ONE.  Graded against the exact 113-bit
// Gamma(a+b)/(Gamma(a)Gamma(b)) rounded once to float32, over the same
// 53,687,093: this code is worst 4 ULP from the true fzu and glibc is worst
