// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// THE nu_c STAGING RULE  (:1832 entry nu_c  vs  :2170 working nu_c)
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// WRF computes nu_c TWICE from two DIFFERENT droplet numbers:
//
//   :1832  nu_c = MIN(15, NINT(1000.E6/nc(k)) + 2)   <- nc(k) from :1829,
