//                          float nwfa_m3, float dt)
//        Homogeneous freezing of deliquesced haze [m^-3].  :5521-5546.
//        log_J capped at 20; result capped at 1000.e3.  Gated by WRF at
//        :2634-2637 on temp < 238 K, ssati >= 0.4 and ns+ni <= 999.e3 --
